I am in the shop.
The shopkeeper has a tablet.
He fills out a form on the tablet.
He asks me, "Madam, what is your name?"
I answer, "My name is Maya."
He writes my name in the form.
Then he asks, "Where are you from?"
I say, "Bhaiya, I am from Mexico."
He is a little surprised.
He smiles and asks, "What is your age?"
I tell my age.
I say, "I am thirty-one years old."
He writes my age in the form.
He asks me for my documents.
I have my passport.
I give him my passport.
He takes a photo of my passport.
He thanks me.
My registration is now complete.
